{"research_date": "2026-09-10", "pairs": [{"pair_id": "conflict_ebe86c0ae52a95dec306fcf8", "claim_ids": ["claim_3b95534cf648bd2671aa93c8", "claim_4be73f74a7f480cf73156449"], "query_ids": ["q_342"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_3b95534cf648bd2671aa93c8", "quote": "Only some products are included on the exemption list for reciprocal tariffs, such as steel (including fasteners) and aluminum products already subject to the 25% Section 232 tariff", "url": "https://www.fastener-world.com/data/pdf_download/FW_212_E_270.pdf?v=2", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "reciprocal tariffs", "affected_product": "steel (including fasteners)", "duty_rate": "25%"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_4be73f74a7f480cf73156449", "quote": "At present, the United States imposes a uniform 50% Section 232 tariff on fastener imports from all countries— except the UK, which is subject to a 25% rate.", "url": "https://www.arkfastech.com/th/knowledge-detail/Carbonitriding__1", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 232", "duty_rate": "50%"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_b189c62d66786cc58d210201", "claim_ids": ["claim_54e9c76c4e8eea1d36c263c1", "claim_9a894affb60828fe9f942e7e"], "query_ids": ["q_342"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_54e9c76c4e8eea1d36c263c1", "quote": "Effective March 12, 2025, the Trump administration eliminated all previous exemptions and implemented a uniform 25% tariff on steel and derivative products, including HTS 7318 fasteners, from all countries", "url": "https://www.arkfastech.com/th/knowledge-detail/Carbonitriding__1", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 232", "effective_date": "March 12, 2025"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_9a894affb60828fe9f942e7e", "quote": "Beginning June 4, 2025, the Section 232 tariff rate was further increased to 50% for steel, aluminum, and their derivative products.", "url": "https://www.arkfastech.com/th/knowledge-detail/Carbonitriding__1", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 232", "effective_date": "June 4, 2025"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_04d0c458e7ee336df6a09310", "claim_ids": ["claim_0658809aeb784c1ae775c459", "claim_412020137629721ca450ce54"], "query_ids": ["q_343"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_0658809aeb784c1ae775c459", "quote": "On April 2, 2026, the federal administration modified Section 232 tariffs on steel, aluminum, and copper imports through a presidential proclamation, with new rules taking effect for goods entered on or after April 6, 2026.", "url": "https://manortool.com/post/april-2026-section-232-tariff-metal-stamping-sourcing", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 232", "announcement_date": "April 2, 2026", "effective_date": "April 6, 2026"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_412020137629721ca450ce54", "quote": "Only auto parts for passenger vehicles and light trucks, as defined by Executive Order 14257, issued April 2, 2025, and subject to Section 232 duties as of May 3, 2025, are not subject to the reciprocal duties effective April 5, 2025, pursuant to heading 9903.01.33, HTSUS.", "url": "https://www.cbp.gov/trade/programs-administration/entry-summary/section-232-additional-faqs-autos", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 232 duties", "affected_product": "auto parts for passenger vehicles and light trucks", "hts_code": "9903.01.33, HTSUS", "effective_date": "May 3, 2025"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_4f547e7b39d8147fe46a28af", "claim_ids": ["claim_0b5aa6bf63dbb29af1e358c0", "claim_0b79b1d31aa3506dc4d14bf3"], "query_ids": ["q_344"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_0b5aa6bf63dbb29af1e358c0", "quote": "The offset applies to automobile parts classified under HTSUS 9903.94.05 or 9903.94.07 and, under the updated guidance, also to MHDV parts classified under HTSUS 9903.74.08 or 9903.74.09.", "url": "https://www.ghy.com/trade-compliance/us-to-apply-a-25-tariff-on-imports-of-autos-and-parts", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"hts_code": "HTSUS 9903.94.05"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_0b79b1d31aa3506dc4d14bf3", "quote": "A 25% tariff took effect on April 3, 2025, for imported automobiles and light trucks, and on May 3, 2025, for specific auto parts such as engines, transmissions, and electrical components.", "url": "https://www.ghy.com/trade-compliance/us-to-apply-a-25-tariff-on-imports-of-autos-and-parts", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Proclamation 10908", "effective_date": "April 3, 2025"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_11729ef6927bcd3564f56da2", "claim_ids": ["claim_6289c66fbb8ab4c5591d5a27", "claim_99f4a71228f7719fc130a3b1"], "query_ids": ["q_344"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_6289c66fbb8ab4c5591d5a27", "quote": "On March 26, 2025, the President issued Proclamation 10908 on Adjusting Imports of Automobiles and Automobile Parts into the United States, imposing a 25 percent ad valorem tariff on parts of passenger vehicles (sedans, sport utility vehicles, crossover utility vehicles, minivans, and cargo vans) and light trucks from all countries, under Section 232 of the Trade Expansion Act of 1962, as amended (19 U.S.C. 1862) (Section 232), effective May 3, 2025.", "url": "https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDHSCBP/bulletins/3de7ef9", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"legal_authority": "Section 232 of the Trade Expansion Act of 1962", "affected_product": "parts of passenger vehicles (sedans, sport utility vehicles, crossover utility vehicles, minivans, and cargo vans) and light trucks", "duty_rate": "25 percent ad valorem"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_99f4a71228f7719fc130a3b1", "quote": "new trade deals have reduced rates for some — including 15% for the EU and Japan, and 10% for select UK vehicles.", "url": "https://blogs.tradlinx.com/auto-tariffs-101-how-u-s-car-import-duties-really-work-in-2025", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "new trade deals", "duty_rate": "15%"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_6d896b0369bda319e57c9dce", "claim_ids": ["claim_02368fa41c8ef35d97d0e762", "claim_0d2878f8ec3c6660b1cb52ff"], "query_ids": ["q_345"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_02368fa41c8ef35d97d0e762", "quote": "This exemption expired at the start of 2020, meaning 25% tariffs on injection molds made in China are a reality once more.", "url": "https://www.thogus.com/blog/post/injection-molding-tariffs-are-reinstated", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"expiration_date": "start of 2020"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_0d2878f8ec3c6660b1cb52ff", "quote": "Annex III of the proclamation provides temporary relief for certain plastics machinery, parts, and molds, including specified Harmonized Tariff Schedule (HTS) lines 8477 and 8480. For these products, a combined duty cap of 15% will apply through Dec. 31, 2027.", "url": "https://www.plasticstoday.com/legislation-regulations/trump-revises-tariffs-impacting-plastics-industry-imports", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Annex III", "affected_product": "certain plastics machinery, parts, and molds", "hts_code": "8477 and 8480", "duty_rate": "15%", "effective_date": "through Dec. 31, 2027"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_8ef22b58ddd3c92e8994b9a6", "claim_ids": ["claim_02368fa41c8ef35d97d0e762", "claim_96c547f338a07bfef8d84f78"], "query_ids": ["q_345"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_02368fa41c8ef35d97d0e762", "quote": "This exemption expired at the start of 2020, meaning 25% tariffs on injection molds made in China are a reality once more.", "url": "https://www.thogus.com/blog/post/injection-molding-tariffs-are-reinstated", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"expiration_date": "start of 2020"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_96c547f338a07bfef8d84f78", "quote": "Bottom line: We can expect cost increases throughout the supply chain as a result of the 25% tariff on Chinese imports, and the sourcing of tooling in custom plastic injection molding is likely to be hit hard.", "url": "https://www.thogus.com/blog/post/injection-molding-tariffs-are-reinstated", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"duty_rate": "25%"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_06c91c48724ab4fa1045b748", "claim_ids": ["claim_0d2878f8ec3c6660b1cb52ff", "claim_9ef663ab27f63ff4ab98e3f4"], "query_ids": ["q_345"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_0d2878f8ec3c6660b1cb52ff", "quote": "Annex III of the proclamation provides temporary relief for certain plastics machinery, parts, and molds, including specified Harmonized Tariff Schedule (HTS) lines 8477 and 8480. For these products, a combined duty cap of 15% will apply through Dec. 31, 2027.", "url": "https://www.plasticstoday.com/legislation-regulations/trump-revises-tariffs-impacting-plastics-industry-imports", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Annex III", "affected_product": "certain plastics machinery, parts, and molds", "hts_code": "8477 and 8480", "duty_rate": "15%", "effective_date": "through Dec. 31, 2027"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_9ef663ab27f63ff4ab98e3f4", "quote": "Starting Jan. 1, 2028, Annex III products will transition to standard tariff treatment outlined in the proclamation.", "url": "https://www.plasticstoday.com/legislation-regulations/trump-revises-tariffs-impacting-plastics-industry-imports", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"expiration_date": "Dec. 31, 2027", "reported_policy_status": "transition to standard tariff treatment"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_4096e9ae6f6b7056147335c2", "claim_ids": ["claim_5cfb0f9cc29effde2ee12247", "claim_f4aac43e5844401d00cb46d3"], "query_ids": ["q_345"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_5cfb0f9cc29effde2ee12247", "quote": "The immediate impact of this tariff was short-lived, however, as of December in the same year, Chinese tooling imports were granted a one-year exemption, in part as a result of concern that the tariff would severely disrupt manufacturing supply chains and damage bottom lines.", "url": "https://www.thogus.com/blog/post/injection-molding-tariffs-are-reinstated", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {}}, {"claim_id": "claim_f4aac43e5844401d00cb46d3", "quote": "On July 6, 2018, the U.S. government instituted a 25% tariff on Chinese imports (including tooling used in custom injection molding), igniting concerns among domestic mold builders and manufacturers who had relied on Chinese imports for tooling.", "url": "https://www.thogus.com/blog/post/injection-molding-tariffs-are-reinstated", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "25% tariff on Chinese imports", "duty_rate": "25%", "effective_date": "July 6, 2018"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_6309a7241fa2f220472b8b7a", "claim_ids": ["claim_c2ea9d50018f4e4d959156a6", "claim_eaea1819a52e3760476d3dea"], "query_ids": ["q_345"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_c2ea9d50018f4e4d959156a6", "quote": "These tariffs range from 10% to 25% and add significantly to the cost of importing tools and components from overseas.", "url": "https://protoshopinc.com/blog/how-tariffs-are-changing-the-plastic-injection-molding-industry", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"duty_rate": "10% to 25%"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_eaea1819a52e3760476d3dea", "quote": "A mold that once cost $20,000 from China could now cost $25,000 or more after tariffs.", "url": "https://protoshopinc.com/blog/how-tariffs-are-changing-the-plastic-injection-molding-industry", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {}}]}]}

